{"timestamp": 1779427309.140684, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 19, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "upper_engine", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779427309.1414657, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 19, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779427319.3352768, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I found Charlie's body in upper engine. \n\nHere's my full route so we have a timeline: I started in navigation, went up to security, then to weapons, back through security to electrical, then medbay, and finally up to upper engine where I found the body.\n\nThe last time I saw Charlie alive was in electrical around ticks 10 and 11. Bob, you were in electrical with Charlie at that exact same time. After I left electrical, I passed Eve in medbay around tick 14 before heading up to upper engine. \n\nBob, you're the last person I saw with Charlie. Where did you go after electrical? Eve, did you see anyone heading up towards upper engine from medbay? Let's hear what everyone else has to say before we vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427329.7617395, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I can corroborate a lot of Alice's timeline. My route was upper engine, then oxygen, back to upper engine, down to medbay, and then electrical. \n\nAlice, I can confirm I saw you pass through medbay around tick 14. But more importantly, I have huge information about Bob and Charlie. At tick 11, I saw Bob enter medbay from electrical. At tick 12, Bob left medbay heading straight up to upper engine. Charlie was also in medbay with us at tick 12. Since Charlie ended up dead in upper engine and Bob headed exactly there right before Charlie would have gone up, Bob is looking extremely suspicious right now. \n\nBob, you have a lot of explaining to do about what you did in upper engine. I'm definitely leaning towards Bob being the Duck based on this timeline. Let's hear what he says."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427342.9948137, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route this round was medbay, up to upper engine, down to lower engine, and finally storage. \n\nI can confirm seeing Bob in medbay very early on, around ticks 2 to 4. I also saw Eve in upper engine around ticks 8 and 9\u2014she had just come from oxygen. \n\nThe most important information I have is about Frank. Frank, I was with you in lower engine from tick 12 to 14, and I saw you enter lower engine *from* upper engine right at tick 12. \n\nSince Alice and Eve are talking about Bob and Charlie moving around electrical and medbay around ticks 11 and 12, and possibly heading to upper engine, Frank's perspective is critical. Frank, you were leaving upper engine right at tick 12\u2014did you see Charlie, Bob, or anyone else up there? \n\nI'm holding my vote to hear from Frank and Bob. Frank has a solid alibi with me for the later part of the round, but we need to know what he saw before he came down to lower engine."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427391.5525026, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Yeah, I get why that looks bad, but the timeline is being framed like I sat in upper engine waiting, and that\u2019s not what happened.\n\nMy route was electrical, medbay, back through electrical/security area, then electrical again, medbay, and I passed upward through upper engine toward oxygen. I did not stop in upper engine and I did not see Charlie\u2019s body there. Charlie was alive in medbay with Eve at tick 12 after the electrical sighting, so Alice\u2019s \u201clast with Charlie\u201d point isn\u2019t the full story.\n\nEve, you saw me leave medbay, but Charlie was still alive there with you too. If Charlie came up behind me into upper engine later, that doesn\u2019t mean I killed him \u2014 it means someone got him after that movement. Also Diana says Frank came down from upper engine around tick 12, so Frank\u2019s info matters a lot here.\n\nI\u2019m not saying hard vote yet, but I don\u2019t like how fast Eve is turning \u201cBob walked that direction\u201d into \u201cBob killed.\u201d I want Frank\u2019s account before we decide."}}
{"timestamp": 1779427413.8542812, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Diana is spot on about our timeline. My full route was Cafeteria -> Oxygen -> Upper Engine -> Lower Engine -> Storage. \n\nTo answer your critical question, Diana: NO, I did not see Bob or Charlie in Upper Engine at all before I left at T12. Upper Engine was completely clear of them. I only saw Eve and Diana there earlier around T8 before they both left at T9. \n\nThis is huge because it proves the murder happened strictly *after* T12. Both Eve and Bob confirm Charlie was alive down in Medbay at T12. Bob just admitted he went from Medbay up through Upper Engine right after that. Since I vacated Upper Engine at T12, it was empty and waiting for Bob and Charlie to walk in. Bob had the perfect opportunity, and his path matches the crime scene exactly.\n\nDiana and I can vouch for each other for the later part of the round. Bob is by far the most logical suspect based on where everyone was after T12. I'm voting Bob."}}
