{"timestamp": 1779427464.3159223, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "You guys are tunneling way too hard and ignoring the one detail that actually matters: Charlie was alive when he came up from medbay into upper engine around tick 14. I was already moving through upper engine toward oxygen \u2014 I didn\u2019t stop there, and I ended the round in cafeteria.\n\nAlice\u2019s own route puts her going medbay -> upper engine right after that, and she\u2019s the one who reports the body. If Charlie entered upper engine at 14 and Alice was coming up behind from medbay, that is absolutely a self-report possibility, or at minimum she was much closer to the actual death than I was by the end.\n\nFrank clearing upper engine before tick 12 doesn\u2019t prove I killed \u2014 it proves the kill happened after Charlie moved up. And Alice was also moving into that exact area right after Charlie. Eve pushing \u201cBob went that direction so Bob killed\u201d is not enough when Alice literally found/reported it after following the same path.\n\nI\u2019m telling you: I passed through to oxygen/cafeteria. I did not kill Charlie. If you vote me here, you\u2019re handing the Duck a free win."}}
